[
  {
    "content_id": "10036001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;当犹大王亚们的儿子约西亚在位的时候，耶和华的话临到希西家的玄孙，亚玛利雅的曾孙，基大利的孙子，古示的儿子西番雅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： 我必从地上除灭万类。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我必除灭人和牲畜， 与空中的鸟、海里的鱼， 以及绊脚石和恶人； 我必将人从地上剪除。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我必伸手攻击犹大 和耶路撒冷的一切居民， 也必从这地方剪除所剩下的巴力， 并基玛林的名和祭司，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;与那些在房顶上敬拜天上万象的， 并那些敬拜耶和华指着他起誓， 又指着玛勒堪起誓的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;与那些转去不跟从耶和华的， 和不寻求耶和华也不访问他的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你要在主耶和华面前静默无声， 因为耶和华的日子快到。 耶和华已经预备祭物， 将他的客分别为圣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;到了我—耶和华献祭的日子， 必惩罚首领和王子， 并一切穿外邦衣服的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;到那日，我必惩罚一切跳过门槛、 将强暴和诡诈得来之物充满主人房屋的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说：当那日， 从鱼门必发出悲哀的声音， 从二城发出哀号的声音， 从山间发出大破裂的响声。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;玛革提施的居民哪，你们要哀号， 因为迦南的商民都灭亡了！ 凡搬运银子的都被剪除。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;那时，我必用灯巡查耶路撒冷； 我必惩罚那些如酒在渣滓上澄清的； 他们心里说： 耶和华必不降福，也不降祸。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他们的财宝必成为掠物； 他们的房屋必变为荒场。 他们必建造房屋，却不得住在其内； 栽种葡萄园，却不得喝所出的酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;耶和华的大日临近， 临近而且甚快， 乃是耶和华日子的风声； 勇士必痛痛地哭号。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;那日是忿怒的日子， 是急难困苦的日子， 是荒废凄凉的日子， 是黑暗幽冥、密云乌黑的日子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;是吹角呐喊的日子， 要攻击坚固城和高大的城楼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我必使灾祸临到人身上， 使他们行走如同瞎眼的， 因为得罪了我。 他们的血必倒出如灰尘； 他们的肉必抛弃如粪土。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;当耶和华发怒的日子， 他们的金银不能救他们； 他的忿怒如火必烧灭全地， 毁灭这地的一切居民，而且大大毁灭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:1-2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1-2</sup>&nbsp;不知羞耻的国民哪，你们应当聚集！ 趁命令没有发出， 日子过去如风前的糠， 耶和华的烈怒未临到你们， 他发怒的日子未到以先， 你们应当聚集前来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;世上遵守耶和华典章的谦卑人哪， 你们都当寻求耶和华！ 当寻求公义谦卑， 或者在耶和华发怒的日子可以隐藏起来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;迦萨必致见弃； 亚实基伦必然荒凉。 人在正午必赶出亚实突的民； 以革伦也被拔出根来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;住沿海之地的基利提族有祸了！ 迦南、非利士人之地啊，耶和华的话与你反对， 说：我必毁灭你，以致无人居住。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;沿海之地要变为草场， 其上有牧人的住处和羊群的圈。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;这地必为犹大家剩下的人所得； 他们必在那里牧放群羊， 晚上必躺卧在亚实基伦的房屋中； 因为耶和华—他们的　神必眷顾他们， 使他们被掳的人归回。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我听见摩押人的毁谤和亚扪人的辱骂， 就是毁谤我的百姓，自夸自大， 侵犯他们的境界。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;万军之耶和华—以色列的　神说： 我指着我的永生起誓： 摩押必像所多玛， 亚扪人必像蛾摩拉， 都变为刺草、盐坑、永远荒废之地。 我百姓所剩下的必掳掠他们； 我国中所余剩的必得着他们的地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;这事临到他们是因他们骄傲，自夸自大， 毁谤万军之耶和华的百姓。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和华必向他们显可畏之威， 因他必叫世上的诸神瘦弱。 列国海岛的居民各在自己的地方敬拜他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;古实人哪，你们必被我的刀所杀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;耶和华必伸手攻击北方，毁灭亚述， 使尼尼微荒凉，又干旱如旷野。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;群畜，就是各国的走兽必卧在其中； 鹈鹕和箭猪要宿在柱顶上。 在窗户内有鸣叫的声音； 门槛都必毁坏， 香柏木已经露出。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;这是素来欢乐安然居住的城， 心里说：惟有我，除我以外再没有别的； 现在何竟荒凉成为野兽躺卧之处！ 凡经过的人都必摇手嗤笑她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;这悖逆、污秽、欺压的城有祸了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;她不听从命令，不领受训诲， 不倚靠耶和华， 不亲近她的　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;她中间的首领是咆哮的狮子； 她的审判官是晚上的豺狼， 一点食物也不留到早晨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;她的先知是虚浮诡诈的人； 她的祭司亵渎圣所， 强解律法。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;耶和华在她中间是公义的， 断不做非义的事， 每早晨显明他的公义，无日不然； 只是不义的人不知羞耻。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我—耶和华已经除灭列国的民； 他们的城楼毁坏。 我使他们的街道荒凉，以致无人经过； 他们的城邑毁灭，以致无人， 也无居民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我说：你只要敬畏我，领受训诲； 如此，你的住处不致照我所拟定的除灭。 只是你们从早起来就在一切事上败坏自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说：你们要等候我， 直到我兴起掳掠的日子； 因为我已定意招聚列国，聚集列邦， 将我的恼怒—就是我的烈怒都倾在她们身上。 我的忿怒如火，必烧灭全地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;那时，我必使万民用清洁的言语 好求告我—耶和华的名， 同心合意地事奉我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;祈祷我的，就是我所分散的民， 必从古实河外来，给我献供物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;当那日，你必不因你一切得罪我的事自觉羞愧； 因为那时我必从你中间除掉矜夸高傲之辈， 你也不再于我的圣山狂傲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我却要在你中间留下困苦贫寒的民； 他们必投靠我—耶和华的名。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;以色列所剩下的人必不作罪孽， 不说谎言，口中也没有诡诈的舌头； 而且吃喝躺卧，无人惊吓。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;锡安的民哪，应当歌唱！ 以色列啊，应当欢呼！ 耶路撒冷的民哪，应当满心欢喜快乐！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;耶和华已经除去你的刑罚， 赶出你的仇敌。 以色列的王—耶和华在你中间； 你必不再惧怕灾祸。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;当那日，必有话向耶路撒冷说： 不要惧怕！锡安哪； 不要手软！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;耶和华—你的　神是施行拯救、 大有能力的主。 他在你中间必因你欢欣喜乐， 默然爱你，且因你喜乐而欢呼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;那些属你、为无大会愁烦、 因你担当羞辱的，我必聚集他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;那时，我必罚办一切苦待你的人， 又拯救你瘸腿的，聚集你被赶出的。 那些在全地受羞辱的， 我必使他们得称赞，有名声。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅书 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;那时，我必领你们进来，聚集你们； 我使你们被掳之人归回的时候， 就必使你们在地上的万民中有名声，得称赞。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  }
]